NOTES=UNPUSHED: 4591600e + 059e5977 (keyguard) — offer push. PIN auth is the real follow-up (credential store /state + keypad + verify + IME-over-lockscreen). Other deferred: lockscreen wallpaper/notifications/rotation/secure-while-locked. Gotcha: 2-min screen timeout sleeps the display during long adb runs → lockscreen auto-locks + black screencap; wake with keyevent 224 before screenshot. Roadmap remaining: Clipboard(task42), PackageManager perms, Signal app features, boot-model(33), Hybrid(46), WasmGC leak(25), power per-app user profiles. Plan: ~/.claude/plans/cat-task-state-steady-stallman.md.
